This one's still in review — sharing the working notes rather than waiting for a finished post.

## What's settled

Tag chips get a background tint instead of a plain text link. Cards on the home list lose a little vertical padding — feedback was that the list felt sparser than it needed to be at ten posts a page.

## What's not settled

Whether the excerpt should truncate at two lines or three on mobile. I have opinions; they are not universally shared. This post gets finished once that argument is.
